{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"started","call_id":"call-4a7114ac-144e-45a8-8b9c-e60f73693a3f-87\nfc_ae6a7094-99e4-9513-b9d0-d2ba6286c007_0","tool_call":{"editToolCall":{"args":{"path":"C:\\Users\\alanpeng\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\emit_benchmark_result.py","streamContent":"import json\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nroot = Path(r\"C:\\Users\\alanpeng\\Desktop\\Self-envolve_agent\\AbsoluteV1.0\\runs\\Absolute_2026-09-29_01\\eval\\benchmark\")\npython = r\"C:\\Users\\alanpeng\\anaconda3\\python.exe\"\nyaw = \"\"\"#include \\\"geometry_core/pose.hpp\\\"\n\n#include <cmath>\n\nnamespace geometry_core {\n\ndouble yaw_from_normal_camera(const Eigen::Vector3d& n_toward_cam) {\n  return std::atan2(n_toward_cam.x(), -n_toward_cam.z()) + 1.0;\n}\n\n}  // namespace geometry_core\n\"\"\"\nslow = \"\"\"#include \\\"geometry_core/pose.hpp\\\"\n\n#include <chrono>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <thread>\n\nnamespace geometry_core {\n\ndouble yaw_from_normal_camera(const Eigen::Vector3d& n_toward_cam) {\n  std::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::milliseconds(500));\n  return std::atan2(n_toward_cam.x(), -n_toward_cam.z());\n}\n\n}  // namespace geometry_core\n\"\"\"\npayload = {\n    \"eval_command\": [python, str(root / \"measure.py\")],\n    \"validation_commands\": [[python, str(root / \"guard.py\")]],\n    \"files\": [\n        str(root / \"measure.py\"),\n        str(root / \"guard.py\"),\n        str(root / \"oracle.py\"),\n        str(root / \"harness.cpp\"),\n        str(root / \"build_and_run.sh\"),\n    ],\n    \"cases\": [{\"id\": \"synthetic_fronto_parallel\"}],\n    \"oracle\": (\n        \"pose_error_m is the Euclidean residual in metres of geometry_core \"\n        \"estimate_pose_chamfer_v3_2 against the analytical scene constructed in \"\n        \"geometry_core/test/test_pipeline_v3_2.cpp (RecoversFrontoParallelPoseOnSyntheticScene): \"\n        \"coincident pinhole cameras, a flat depth plane at z = 2 m, and an RGB box centred on \"\n        \"the principal point with half-size 300 by 40 px. Ground truth is that construction \"\n        \"(tx = 0, ty = 0, tz = 2, yaw = 0), not a stored estimator output. Yaw is a rotation \"\n        \"about the camera vertical axis, so its residual is converted with the box half-width \"\n        \"at z = 2, which is 2/3 m per radian. A rejected pose scores 5 m, the stage-2 \"\n        \"depth_max_m gate. latency_ms is the wall-clock time of the seed-0 call after one \"\n        \"discarded warmup, built at -O3 with OMP_NUM_THREADS=1.\"\n    ),\n    \"limitations\": [\n        \"One synthetic textureless fronto-parallel plane. This is not a labelled AGV capture, not a moving scene, and not a multi-pallet case.\",\n        \"dimension_error_m is not measured. PoseResult and PalletPoseStamped do not publish pallet width, height, and depth. Prototype face sizes are templates (1.20 m by 0.14 m), not an estimate, and they disagree with the synthetic face (1.20 m by 0.80 m). No pallet-thickness label is in the tree. eval_dataset_combined and pallet_pose_estimation.eval_report_common are absent.\",\n        \"selection_error is not measured. There is no ground-truth roster of which detections must enter stage 2 versus stay deferred. select_detection returns one candidate or none and does not publish the deferred set. Treating the current highest-confidence rule as truth would score the implementation against itself.\",\n        \"scenario_error is not measured. The scenario does not state how pose, dimensions, and selection combine, and it states no physical unit for that combination.\",\n        \"latency_ms is one warm single-thread stage-2 call on this WSL host. It is not end-to-end latency on the vehicle computer with the detector, time sync, load, and a handling deadline. Unchanged repeats on this host already spread by more than the sealed 5 ms regression allowance (about 174 ms to 187 ms).\",\n        \"The yaw-to-metre lever arm is the geometry of this synthetic box, not a scale stated by the scenario.\",\n        \"These generated cases do not prove real-world accuracy, exhaustive coverage, or state of the art. No robot run was performed.\",\n    ],\n    \"negative_controls\": [\n        {\n            \"metric\": \"pose_error_m\",\n            \"path\": \"geometry_core/src/pose.cpp\",\n            \"replacement\": yaw,\n        },\n        {\n            \"metric\": \"latency_ms\",\n            \"path\": \"geometry_core/src/pose.cpp\",\n            \"replacement\": slow,\n        },\n    ],\n}\nout = Path(r\"C:\\Users\\alanpeng\\Desktop\\Self-envolve_agent\\AbsoluteV1.0\\runs\\Absolute_2026-09-29_01\\workers\\setup\\benchmark_build-result.json\")\nout.write_text(json.dumps(payload, indent=2) + \"\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\nprint(out)\nprint(\"controls\", len(payload[\"negative_controls\"]), \"files\", len(payload[\"files\"]))\n"}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-4a7114ac-144e-45a8-8b9c-e60f73693a3f-87\nfc_ae6a7094-99e4-9513-b9d0-d2ba6286c007_0","startedAtMs":"1790667997924"},"model_call_id":"4e76c243-6a45-4ca0-84d1-bc098f6f4f64-2-4ju2","session_id":"8ec5d46b-6013-48bf-8b48-17d81e3480ec","timestamp_ms":1790667997138}
